Description: Notify OpenXR when the paired phone reference changes
 Carry mapped capture time into the world reference-space events.
 Retain a bounded previous-origin sample for queries before the change.
 Invalidate old history when a new paired source reconnects.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Origin: other, carried edition runtime adapter
Forwarded: no, held for paired qualification and review
Last-Update: 2026-11-20

